Feature  Summary
----------------

 o  Available for DOS and Windows

 o  Multiple Windows and files and multiple files in each window

 o  VM engine handles very large files

 o  Extensive context sensitive help
 
 o  Context sensitive Windows SDK help. Also supports Borland C++

 o  Unlimited Undo and Redo
 
 o  Color Syntax highlighting with user defined language word lists.

 o  Rectangular column blocks, plus stream and line
 
 o  Block cut, paste, write, sort, search, case change etc.

 o  Named keyboard macros

 o  Regular expression search and replace, Incremental search
 
 o  Search for Tabs, control characters etc.
 
 o  Search across all buffers and files, including entire directory trees
    and across all drives. 

 o  File difference analysis for comparing files.
 
 o  Emulates Brief, MultiEdit, Wordstar, Norton, Qedit, Wordperfect...

 o  Fully configurable menus, keyboard etc

 o  Windows Toolbar. Position on any border, or floating

 o  Language sensitive editing for C/C++, Clipper/dBase/FoxPro, Cobol,
    Fortran, Progress, Paradox, Pascal, DataFlex and Assembler.

 o  Code templates, code completion, smart indenting

 o  Comment, bracket and object matching

 o  Hypertext like function and procedure lookup. Smart C++ method lookup.
 
 o  dBase/Clipper DBF file field extraction
 
 o  Ruler for measuring strings etc.

 o  Text selection drag and drop
 
 o  File drag and drop from File manager.
 
 o  Printing with Font selection, headings, line numbers etc.
 
 o  Support for editing Unix files
 
 o  Support for Mainframe DOS emulations

 o  Works with File manager for Opening and Printing files
 
 o  Hunt for files across all directories on any or all drives
 
 o  View directory trees
 
 o  Windows Font selection. DOS Super VGA support - 132 x 60+

 o  Auto-save, Backup files, Session recall

 o  Extensive compiler support with error tracking

 o  Fast C extension language with source included.  Access to
    user defined dialog boxes and string tables.

 o  Full LAN and multiuser support

 o  Word wrap and paragraph reformat
 
 o  Lets other Applications run during lengthy operations
 
 o  Japanese and German versions available 

 o  350 Page manual.


ED is designed for the 90's and gives you the absolute leading
edge in programmer's editors. Discover the tool for DOS and
Windows that frees you from the tedium of editing and lets your
creative instincts flow!

No developers' toolkit is complete without ED, the power
programmers' editor.

